From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ethan Hill <ethan.hill1999@outlook.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 09:08:58 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 12/13] KitKat UI P20: full shade/QS donor rebuild

- 20.2a NotificationShadeDepthController.shouldApplyShadeBlur -> false
  (shade blur/zoom off; keyguard pipeline untouched) - risk-ruled
  approximation per user decision.
- 20.2c NotificationsQSContainerController: shade_bottom_handle rides
  the expansion edge (donor NotificationPanelView.draw semantics) via
  ShadeExpansionStateManager listener.
- 20.3 FooterView.setFooterLabelVisible: normal path keeps BOTH
  buttons hidden (legacy branch re-showed them every layout pass,
  defeating the 18.3 ViewModel hide) - donor had no footer buttons.
- 20.4 combined_qs_header: donor 50dp ic_notify_settings +
  ic_notify_button_bg on both header buttons (art ported per density).
- 20.6 qs_tile_margin_* 8dp -> 4dp (donor quick_settings_cell_gap).
- 20.7 shadeActive/shadeInactive #2d2d2d -> #ff161616 (donor
  qs_tile_background flat color), ripple color -> #ff212121 donor
  press, square tile corners.
- 20.8 QSPanel.setBrightnessView: inline slider NOT attached (tile +
  dialog per donor) - plumbing intact, one-line revert.
- 20.9 TextAppearance.StatusBar.Expanded.Clock/.Date -> donor values
  (32dp light white / 12dp #cccccc caps); header clock/date pill.
- 20.10 quick_settings_tiles_default -> donor set+order (user,
  brightness, settings, wifi, cell, battery, bt, location, rotation);
  KitKat{Brightness,Settings,User}Tile + KitKatQSTilesModule added.
- 20.1 (LatinIME fork) functionalTextColor -> white: ?123/ABC layout
  keys were painting transparent (blank toggle keys).
Verified on emulator: donor 3-col grid with 4dp gaps + #161616 flat
tiles on gradient page, footer buttons gone, toggle keys render,
zero FATALs.
